%%{init: {'sequence': {'htmlLabels': false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Oncologist
  participant EHR as Oncology EHR
  participant CRD as CRD Service
  participant DTR as DTR Client
  participant PAS as PAS Service
  participant Payer as Payer Backend

  Oncologist->>EHR: Open chart / begin treatment planning
  Oncologist->>EHR: Select anti-cancer regimen from order-set
  EHR->>EHR: Create draft RequestGroup (instantiatesCanonical → PlanDefinition)

  rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Oncologist,EHR: order-select — Informational Approvability Check
    EHR->>CRD: CDS Hooks order-select (RequestGroup + fhirAuthorization)
    CRD->>EHR: Query FHIR server for oncology context (Condition, Observation, MedicationRequest)
    EHR-->>CRD: Patient context (diagnosis, stage, biomarkers, ECOG, prior therapy)
    CRD->>CRD: Evaluate context completeness and coverage criteria

    alt Context complete + criteria satisfied
      CRD-->>EHR: Approvable — PA can be bypassed (info)
    else Context incomplete
      CRD-->>EHR: DTR launch card (warning)
      EHR->>DTR: Launch DTR (collects missing data via questionnaire)
      Note over DTR: DTR collects data but does NOT persist to EHR FHIR server
      DTR-->>EHR: Completed QuestionnaireResponse (held in EHR session)
    else Criteria not met
      CRD-->>EHR: PA will be required (warning)
    end

    EHR-->>Oncologist: Present approvability cards (advisory, not yet signed)
  end

  Oncologist->>EHR: Sign order
  Note over EHR: RequestGroup + finalised component MedicationRequests

  rect rgb(240, 248, 240)
    Note over Oncologist,EHR: order-sign — Final Determination
    EHR->>CRD: CDS Hooks order-sign (RequestGroup + MedicationRequests + fhirAuthorization)
    CRD->>EHR: Query FHIR server for oncology context
    EHR-->>CRD: Patient context (may still be missing data — DTR responses are not persisted to FHIR server)
    CRD->>CRD: Final coverage determination

    alt Authorization satisfied
      CRD-->>EHR: Authorization Satisfied (success) — PA bypassed
    else PA required
      CRD-->>EHR: PA required (warning)
    else Context still incomplete
      CRD-->>EHR: DTR launch card (warning) — data still missing
      EHR->>DTR: Launch DTR again (collect remaining missing data)
      Note over DTR: DTR collects data but does NOT persist to EHR FHIR server
      DTR-->>EHR: Completed QuestionnaireResponse (held in EHR session)
      EHR-->>Oncologist: DTR complete — proceed to PA submission
    end

    EHR-->>Oncologist: Display final determination
  end

  opt PA required or DTR was launched
    EHR->>PAS: Submit PA request (including QuestionnaireResponse(s) from DTR)
    PAS->>Payer: Transmit for adjudication
    Payer-->>PAS: PA decision (approved / pended / denied)
    PAS-->>EHR: ClaimResponse with determination
    EHR-->>Oncologist: Display PA outcome
  end
